onant-review", "image_url": "https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Control-Resonant-review-BB.png?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Rock Paper Shotgun", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "Control Resonant's roaring melee battles and grasp of cosmic weirdness put this unlikely sequel up there with Remedy’s finest work.\n\nDeveloper: Remedy", "published_at": "2026-09-18T13:00:49Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-19T11:32:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-200ef1815697.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-27c9ec9881a1", "title": "FAA tees up $875M AI tool to help manage air traffic congestion", "source": "Ars Technica", "author": "Jeremy Hsu", "url": "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/09/faa-tees-up-875m-ai-tool-to-help-manage-air-traffic-congestion/", "image_url": "https://cdn.arstechnica.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DCA-airport-1152x648.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Ars Technica", "Tech", "en", "tech", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "An AI tool is set to start advising air traffic controllers on managing air traffic in the congested airspace above the Washington, DC, area. The expected", "published_at": "2026-09-18T19:20:50Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-19T11:32:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-27c9ec9881a1.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-2f411da82478", "title": "AI 硬件创业者，疯狂涌入手机的背面", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370610", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/96/29/9629ea19bc24f815142a0db19fc07bae.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "c